<BaseLayout title="Methodology" description="Methodology — Calderstone Research">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
      <h1 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Methodology</h1>
      <p>Our research methodology is designed to ensure transparency, reproducibility, and accountability. Every report discloses its criteria, evidence classes, and limitations.</p><h2>Research Process</h2><ol><li><strong>Define Criteria</strong> — Evaluation criteria are fixed before any vendor or entity is named</li><li><strong>Collect Evidence</strong> — Primary and secondary sources, structured against published criteria</li><li><strong>Independent Review</strong> — Named reviewers evaluate methodology and evidence quality</li><li><strong>Publish with Disclosure</strong> — Full methodology, limitations, and evidence classes disclosed</li></ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
